OL,3,AEleven injured in shooting outside
OL,4,ATurkish school
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven people have been injured in a
OL,7,Fshooting outside a high school in
OL,8,FTurkey, with police detaining a
OL,9,F15-year-old male suspect.
OL,11,FTwo people were left in critical
OL,12,Fconditions after a gunman opened fire
OL,13,Fbefore fleeing on Tuesday morning,
OL,15,FIt happened at the Inci Uzmez
OL,16,FVocational and Technical Anatolian High
OL,17,FSchool in the western province of
OL,18,FManisa, with the injured reportedly all
OL,19,Fstudents.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
